Catch the ship, catch the ship, tower holding tight

00:03:46.820 --> 00:03:48.040
Booster and the ship, a double catch in sight

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:52.220
Full reuse, close the loop, fly and fly again

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:55.600
Starbase, Starbase, count it down to ten

00:03:55.620 --> 00:03:56.420
Catch the ship

00:03:58.620 --> 00:03:59.420
Chopsticks open

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:03.240
Catch the ship

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:06.140
Bring it home

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:09.290
Stainless steel heart

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:12.890
Starbase lights

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:15.030
This was Nova Red
